WEBVTT

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:34.910
Lala-san.

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:37.120
I drew a bath, so you can go in first.

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.820
Ah, Mikan! Okay!

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:42.230
Hm? What are you making?

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:44.310
Just a little something.

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:58.340
Nemesis-san! Using the principal as a 
chair is a violation of school regulations!

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:58.860
<b>m 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 97 324 97 324 97 324 b 117 286 143 269 181 273 b 153 295 177 318 193 314 b 176 321 172 328 172 342 b 166 328 152 327 142 348 b 150 304 130 304 97 324  </b>

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:58.860
「Multiplication

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:58.860
~From the front and behind~」

00:00:58.340 --> 00:00:59.080
Why?

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:02.850
He seems to be enjoying it, so I don't see a problem.

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:03.830
No.

00:01:04.490 --> 00:01:09.330
{No. }Just seeing this creature in delight in my field of vision is a nuisance.

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:13.690
Yami-oneechan, I feel bad for the principal with you speaking so harshly of him.

00:01:13.690 --> 00:01:15.340
I'm fine!

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:20.450
Being used as a chair and scolded by students is my way of life!

00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:22.720
It's overflowing!

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:25.610
My burning pathos!

00:01:25.610 --> 00:01:26.600
Disgusting.

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:27.750
That's enough.

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:30.110
Leave the manga on my desk.

00:01:30.110 --> 00:01:31.520
Yes, master!

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:34.120
A little girl is bossing me around!

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:36.150
I'm turned on!

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:42.000
Since you're a student too now, you should take it a little more seriously, Neme-chan.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.790
Oh? Are you taking it seriously, Mea?

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:46.660
Of course!

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:48.200
Oh, that's right.

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:50.190
How about having a battle with me, Mea?

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:53.250
If we don't move our bodies once in a while, we'll become weak.

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:54.510
Battle?

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:56.670
Hey, Mea won't go along with that ridiculous-

00:01:56.670 --> 00:01:57.430
Let's do it!

00:01:57.430 --> 00:01:58.300
Eh?!

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:00.930
Right there, Neme-chan!

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:02.080
You're too soft, Mea!

00:02:02.080 --> 00:02:05.300
Hey! What are you two doing?!

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:06.930
Good grief.

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:10.520
I won't let you off for trying to leave me out.

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:11.190
Hey!

00:02:12.390 --> 00:02:14.510
Wai- Even Yami-chan?!

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:18.450
Battling on school grounds is a disruption of public morality!

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:34.380
Yuuki-kun.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:36.210
Sairenji, I'll carry these for you.

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:42.930
m -5 33 l -5 33 l -11 182 l -8 182 l 363 -8 l 283 -152 l -5 33

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:42.930
<b>Staff Room</b>

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:42.930
m -5 33 l -5 33 l -11 182 l -8 182 l 363 -8 l 283 -152 l -5 33

00:02:43.610 --> 00:02:45.450
Thank you for the help.

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:47.360
It's fine, don't worry about it.

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:50.850
You're so kind.

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:55.980
Rito! Haruna!

00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:58.990
Lala!

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:00.010
Lala-san!

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:01.500
Huh, what's going on?

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:03.970
This is a nice mood, did I interrupt you?

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:05.780
T-That's not-

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:08.750
Geez, you don't have to be shy about it.

00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:10.440
What's that?

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:14.750
This is Nyan-Nyan-Copy-kun, which I made at Mikado-sensei's request.

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:19.260
She wanted a mecha that could copy rare medicinal plants, so I made this.

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:24.290
The main copying function is difficult, so I haven't finished it yet, though.

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:25.600
Why does it look like a cat?

00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:27.430
It's cuter that way, right?

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:31.100
It even has alarm clock and music playback modes, too!

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:34.560
When it gets tired of playing, it can go into sleep mode.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:38.780
Why do you have other functions in it when the main copy function is incomplete...?

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:40.790
But it's cute!

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:42.960
That's true.

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:50.000
Yuuki-kun!

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:53.760
A-Are you okay, Rito?

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:56.420
H-Hey, what was that crackling just now?

00:03:56.800 --> 00:04:03.440
Any object that comes into contact with Nyan-Nyan-Copy-Kun's unique static electricity should be copied and split into two.

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:04.340
Eh?!

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:07.880
But seeing as there isn't any change to Rito's body,

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:10.100
it looks like it still needs some adjustment

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.500
Thank goodness!

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:12.990
What's with that?

00:04:12.990 --> 00:04:14.480
Onee-sama!

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:15.550
Momo!

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:19.230
A mecha that looks like one of your inventions just ran that way.

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:20.470
Is everything okay?

00:04:20.470 --> 00:04:21.730
Oh, that's right!

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:23.320
We have to hurry up and capture it!

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:30.580
Haruna!

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:43.010
No!

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:53.020
I'm sorry, Sairenji!

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:54.520
Huh?

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:56.600
What the heck is going on?!

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:58.040
There are two Ritos!

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:00.340
What's going on, Onee-sama?

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:04.280
Lala-sama, could it be Nyan-Nyan-Copy-kun's effect?!

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.780
What do we do, Lala?

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:07.590
I-It's okay!

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:11.600
If you firmly grip Copy-kun's tail, the copy effect resets!

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:13.720
The tail, right?

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:14.580
All right.

00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:22.210
Okay, over here.

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:24.590
Come here.

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:25.840
Ah!

00:05:26.150 --> 00:05:29.240
He's really frightened because of what happened before, huh.

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:31.160
This is bad.

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:48.820
Does this mean I'll keep multiplying...?

00:05:58.340 --> 00:06:00.830
Huh? One of Lala-chan's mechas?

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:02.420
Wait!

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:09.590
He was a sextuplet?!

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:10.500
Damn it.

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:13.520
We've split even more while chasing it and now there are six of me!

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:15.660
Where did Nyan-Nyan-Copy-kun go?!

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:17.480
No choice, we'll have to split up and search!

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:20.150
Hey! Copy-kun!

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:22.980
This really has become troublesome.

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:25.810
This is a chance to save Rito-san.

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:27.860
I have to show him I'm a reliable woman.

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:31.490
Geez. It's not here.

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:36.740
Ah! It's so cute!

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:39.610
This is one of big sister's mechas.

00:06:39.610 --> 00:06:41.460
Here. Come here.

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:43.290
Nana! Kotegawa!

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:44.700
Yuuki-kun?

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:45.800
Why are there two of you?

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:49.680
Please, grab his tail!

00:07:01.980 --> 00:07:03.110
W-Wai-

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:09.240
Oh-Oh no!

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:13.360
Rito's shameless ability is bad enough with just one of him.

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:15.740
When he splits and it multiplies,

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:19.580
it will become even more powerful and inescapable.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:21.580
No!

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:25.210
Why are there a bunch of Yuuki Ritos?!

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:26.300
Saki-sama!

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:28.300
What in the world is going on here?!

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:33.830
T-This is...!

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:38.970
Help me!

00:07:41.510 --> 00:07:42.480
Yuuki!

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:46.480
I can't handle this many at once!

00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:49.510
Rito-kun-

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:52.030
There are a bunch of Rito-kuns!

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:56.400
Wait!

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:02.300
Just a little more!

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:03.920
Found you!

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:04.870
Lala!

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:06.000
Stop!

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:20.750
S-Stop, Rito!

00:08:26.490 --> 00:08:27.820
Wait!

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:34.740
Hey, wait!

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:35.820
Wait!

00:08:37.690 --> 00:08:40.080
Are you really going to do it, Yami-oneechan?

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:42.100
If sneezing is the trigger,

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:45.580
the only way is to cause all of the Yuuki Ritos to lose consciousness at the same time.

00:08:47.030 --> 00:08:48.800
Let's go, Mea.

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:51.710
I'll try not to make it hurt, Senpai!

00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:55.720
This is...

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:04.040
Impossible, isn't it?

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:04.850
Yep.

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:27.050
Aren't you glad, Princess Momo?

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:29.530
The harem you wished for is complete.

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:31.480
Or rather, a reverse harem?

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:34.380
No, I don't want it anymore.

00:09:43.190 --> 00:09:44.390
Celine-chan.

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:50.990
I see.

00:09:50.990 --> 00:09:53.080
It got tired and fell asleep, huh?

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:03.660
I see.

00:10:03.850 --> 00:10:08.250
Thanks to Celine, the copies stopped multiplying.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:11.920
Man, I wasn't sure how it would turn out for a bit there.

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:14.700
I thought it was the end of the Earth.

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:16.150
That's true.

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:17.780
If we hadn't found the mecha,

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:21.180
the Earth might have been overrun with Rito-sans.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:25.310
Well, that's certainly good, but...

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:28.860
How long will Rito stay like that?

00:10:28.860 --> 00:10:34.560
I guess it'll take a little longer for the copy effect to wear off.

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:41.860
It won't hurt if I take one home with me, right?

00:10:41.860 --> 00:10:43.120
S-Shameless!
